    "m_Title": "BasicTextureWithColor",
    "m_Content": "This Shader takes in a texture that, based on its alpha value, it blends different strengths of the given Color parameter to these pixels.\n\nIf no alpha value is defined in a pixel, the raw texture is outputted.\n\n",
